# .graphifyignore — WiBOO / Wibx platform
# Goal: maximize architectural signal, minimize noise. Index source, domain
# code, contracts, migrations, infra, ADRs, memories, devlogs, tests that encode
# business rules. Exclude generated, binary, cached, reproducible artifacts.
#
# Format: gitignore-style, last-match-wins, `!` re-includes. A `.graphifyignore`
# only EXCLUDES; everything not matched here is indexed by default — so the
# "always index" intent (docs/**, src/**, libs/**, apps/**, services/**,
# liquibase/**, migrations/**, TypeORM entities, DTOs, repositories, workers,
# queues, BPMN, SmartForms, CPM/FIN/DES/BGM/WLC, etc.) needs no entry: it simply
# is not excluded below.
#
# Lockfiles are intentionally NOT ignored (package-lock.json, yarn.lock,
# pnpm-lock.yaml): for WiBOO they document package versions and dependency
# evolution. Re-add them here only if the graph becomes too noisy.

